{"unit_id":"hzthzt__dsh-skill-switch#card-zh","repo":"hzthzt/dsh-skill-switch","commit":"1b331cceb908b53b3691a0e8ca8c1179883c61ee","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-switch 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 的 Windows 技能管理插件，在 DSH 设置页提供 Skills 页面。它扫描中央目录中的 SKILL.md 技能包，展示状态并支持搜索筛选、单项启停、批量停用和修改来源路径。启用时在 DSH skills 目录建立 Junction，停用前核对链接身份，已有外部目标会显示为冲突。适合希望选择性管理全局 DSH Skills 的 Windows 用户；默认目录为 ~/.cc-switch/skills，无需 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:24-50","src/client/SkillSwitchSection.tsx:53-60","src/index.ts:33-55","src/manager.ts:36-70","src/manager.ts:130-156"]}
